@ref s 2016(h)(9)(B) a State agency that requires a photograph sets procedures so any other appropriate household member or authorized representative may use the card (src:1028-1029)
GIVEN `the State agency requires a photograph on the card under subparagraph (A)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the State agency has established procedures to ensure that any other appropriate member of the household or any authorized representative of the household may utilize the card` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2016(h)(9)(B) the State agency has done what the subparagraph requires` MEANS
    BRANCH
