            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If a State agency requires a photograph on an electronic benefit card under subparagraph (A), the State agency shall establish procedures"
            -- note (a failed "if"; see NOTES.md, Marginal readings)
            JUST FALSE
        IF `the State agency has established procedures to ensure that any other appropriate member of the household or any authorized representative of the household may utilize the card` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE
            -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text states no time by which the procedures must be established
            NOTHING

§§ `s 2016(h)(10) and (11) federal law and anti-tying`

